      "id": "30e531a3-60d8-4377-88c2-f0a7e26825f0",
      "title": "Eclipse: Shadows Rise – Official Launch",
      "description": "A striking launch page introducing the upcoming action‑adventure game Eclipse: Shadows Rise, highlighting its world, gameplay, and early‑access sign‑up.",
      "slug": "",
      "theme": {
        "background": "#F5F7FA",
        "surface": "#FFFFFF",
        "text": "#1A1A1A",
        "accent": "#0057B8",
        "font": "sans"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "ae8c7597-c1c9-4111-988f-c9973bfeb841",
          "type": "eyebrow",
          "text": "NEW RELEASE"
        },
        {
          "id": "abf431cf-eede-45a7-a924-9d2c9217ad2b",
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Eclipse: Shadows Rise"
        },
        {
          "id": "e5601db9-f806-4a92-b96e-0195df28785d",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step into a fractured realm where light battles darkness in an ever‑shifting world. Every decision reshapes the horizon, and only the bold survive the eclipse."
        },
        {
          "id": "bd04be80-9ab6-4ccf-a9bf-55b7be7b4a09",
          "type": "image",
          "text": "",
          "url": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "fb6cf0d9-4fef-48e3-9c79-8bf2ff9b284a",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Dynamic combat blends melee, ranged, and arcane abilities, letting you craft a style as unique as the shadows you chase. Adaptive AI ensures every encounter feels fresh, whether you’re dueling a phantom or navigating a collapsing citadel."
        },
        {
          "id": "fae8cba5-4471-4ad7-8019-430f13342875",
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Uncover the lost chronicle of the Eclipse Order, a saga of betrayal, redemption, and a power that can rewrite reality. Explore sprawling biomes—from neon‑lit megacities to ancient ruins—each teeming with secrets."
        },
        {
          "id": "0dbe1c83-91b3-4aec-9d32-96ada0e6b7c0",
          "type": "links",
          "text": "Stay Connected",
          "links": [
            {
              "label": "Twitter",
              "url": "#"
            },
            {
              "label": "Discord",
              "url": "#"
            },
            {
              "label": "YouTube",
              "url": "#"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "fd8e1514-cf3b-4bff-bf06-1e15953d190c",
          "type": "form",
          "text": "Ready to embark? Sign up for early access and be the first to experience the eclipse.",
          "buttonText": "Join Waitlist"
        },
        {
          "id": "c4e4ed58-78a6-4ccd-9f6f-6cdaab331507",
          "type": "button",
          "text": "",
          "url": "#"
        }
      ],
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-25T20:57:43.885Z",
      "publishedAt": null
    },
